• CQN as a dependency. Optional optimisation only; the system must be fully correct without it.
Two things the agent should push back on
1. If the index on the modified-date column does not exist, stop and escalate. Every part of this plan assumes an index range scan. Polling every 30 seconds without one is worse than the hourly job it replaces.
2. If OVERLAP_SEC is proposed to be reduced to "save load," reject it. The re-read costs a handful of rows. The failure it prevents is a missed P1.
